<title>USA: Material Sciences Nadig adds CEO duties.</title>
<headline>Material Sciences Nadig adds CEO duties.</headline>
<dateline>ELK GROVE VILLAGE, Ill. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Material Sciences Corp said Friday its directors named Gerald Nadig, currently president and chief operating officer, to the additional post of chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Nadig, 51, succeeds G. Robert Evans, 65, who remains chairman.</p>
<p>The change is effective January 1, 1997.  </p>
<p>Material Sciences provides continuously processed specialty coated materials used by manufacturers and distributors.</p>
<p>Shares of Material Sciences were trading at 18, unchanged from yesterday's close.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
